cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VisualMetrics: an interactive visual laboratory for statistics, econometrics, causal inference and machine learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Roudane
    given-names: Merwan
    email: merwanroudane920@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/visualmetrics"
url: "https://github.com/merwanroudane/visualmetrics"
abstract: >-
  VisualMetrics is a trilingual (English, Arabic, French) interactive visual
  laboratory for statistics, statistical inference, econometrics, causal
  inference, machine learning and modern AI. Every figure and animation
  declares the kind of evidence it provides, every animation explains itself
  frame by frame, and every proof states what it does not establish.
keywords:
  - statistics
  - econometrics
  - causal inference
  - machine learning
  - statistical education
  - data visualization
  - Arabic
  - French
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
